<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil costs exceed proceeds.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil costs exceed proceeds.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil &amp; Gas Royalty Trust said Friday its class A costs for the month of June exceeded gross proceeds by $1,194,718, increasing the cumulative class A cost carry-forward to $7,299,136.</p>
<p>The trust said there will be no distribution for June. It last made a distribution in October 1995.</p>
<p>In addition, the current month trust administrative expenses of $18,424 will be paid from the trust administrative expense reserve, resulting in about $1.8 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
</text>
